// Go workspace for the Unbored backend.
//
// Two modules for now:
//   ./packages/go/platform — shared library (config, logging, errors, HTTP, auth)
//   ./services             — one module holding every service, each with its own
//                            cmd/<service> binary so they deploy independently.
//
// A service graduates to its own module when it needs an independent release
// cadence or dependency set; `go work use` then gains that module and nothing
// else changes. See docs/decisions/0001-go-module-strategy.md.
go 1.27

use (
	./packages/go/platform
	./services
)
